<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Finance companies started as buys.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Finance companies started as buys.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney analyst Dean Eberlin started coverage of DVI Inc and Financial Federal Corp Thursday with ratings of buy, a source at the brokerage said.</p>
<p>-- Shares in DVI closed Wednesday at 11-3/4.  Those of Financial Federal opened up Thursday 1/8 to 16-3/4.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
